+strings ARE in `.rdata` (`UnitHealth` 0x4FA0F68, `RunScript` 0x4F45FA8,
+`TargetUnit` 0x4F8BDF0, `UnitName` 0x4F8ED08, `UnitExists` 0x4F9FDE8...)
+but NO `.data` pointer references them, so they have no static table entry.
